<rml>
<head>
    <title>Loading</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="base.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="explore.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- The loading screen (task explore 02): the route's loading image (the
     TRK's LoadingScreen, else load.ace) over the view, its shape kept, and
     the route's name; it stays until the run's train is on the track, the
     seconds of that under the name. TSRE sets the picture's src, the name
     and the status (src/explore/ExploreRun.cpp). -->
<body class="page loading">
    <div id="loading-frame"><img id="loading-picture"/></div>
    <div id="loading-name"></div>
    <div id="loading-status"></div>
</body>
</rml>
